OL,3,GNEWSASouth West Water waiting for
OL,4,A'recharge season'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water has said the region is
OL,7,Fwaiting for its "recharge season" to
OL,8,Frefill its reservoirs.
OL,10,FThe Environment Agency declared more
OL,11,Fthan half of England as being in
OL,12,Fdrought at the end of July and on 15
OL,13,FOctober, this was escalated to severe
OL,14,Fdrought for parts of Cornwall, Devon,
OL,15,FDorset, Somerset, East Sussex, and West
OL,16,FSussex.
OL,18,FAs of 19 October, Wimbleball in Devon,
OL,19,Fwhich supplies more than 400,000 people
OL,20,Fincluding Exeter, was 13% full and in
OL,21,FCornwall, Stithians was at 19%.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
