OL,3,GNEWSASouth West Water waiting for
OL,4,A'recharge season'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company's drought programme
OL,7,Fdirector Richard Stanbrook said there
OL,8,Fhad been "a lot of focus" on the low
OL,9,Freservoir levels.
